          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Is this platform enough for my complete placement preparation?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, our platform covers everything you need for placements, including coding practice, aptitude preparation, technical MCQs, and interview preparation along with company-specific exam resources."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Can I practice programming exercises on this platform?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, we offer programming exercises in multiple programming languages including Python, C Programming, Java, C++, JavaScript, SQL, HTML, CSS, and C#."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Do you provide topic-wise technical MCQs for preparation?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, our MCQs are carefully categorized by topic and include questions of different difficulty levels."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Are there solutions and explanations for practice questions?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, every question comes with a detailed solution and explanation to help you understand the concepts better and learn from your mistakes."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Do you provide resources to prepare for technical and HR interviews?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, we provide resources for both technical and HR interviews, including detailed preparation guides."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Do you offer career guidance to help students with placements?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yes, we offer career guidance support, and students can easily request a career guidance call by filling out a simple form on our platform."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Is this platform free, or do I need a subscription?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "The platform is 100% free to use. There are no hidden charges or subscription fees."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Every student has their own story. Find the guidance and resources you need to make learning fun and smart. Let's shape a future that feels right for you"
